<title>CHINA: Shenzhen Shenbao first-half net slumps 7.</title>
<headline>Shenzhen Shenbao first-half net slumps 7.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year ended June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1996 figures):</p>
<p>    Turnover		 58.39	 vs  153.75</p>
<p>    Net Profits	     2.85	 vs   11.41</p>
<p>    Earnings per share    0.017 yuan vs    0.082 yuan</p>
<p>    Net assets per share  1.63 yuan  vs    1.70 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Shenzhen Shenbao Industrial Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Note: The results, reflecting international accounting standards, were published in a report in the Shenzhen-based Securities Times on Saturday.</p>
<p>Company says stake in Shenzhen Pepsi-Cola Co Ltd reduced this year to 40 percent from 88 percent in year-ago period.</p>
</text>
